<node id="1161433" title="Re^2: How can I test for the representation of an integer?" created="2016-04-25 06:13:23" updated="2016-04-25 06:13:23" _doctext_mode="lenient"><type id="11">note</type>
<author id="699328">sm@sh</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Here's why - two regexps which return an array with the same result, but for different reasons&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;code&gt;
~$ perl -MData::Dumper -e 'print Dumper("1" =~ /1/)'
$VAR1 = 1;
~$ perl -MData::Dumper -e 'print Dumper("1" =~ /(1)/)'
$VAR1 = '1';
&lt;/code&gt;
</doctext>
